UPDATE companies SET description='Live Edge Slabs of Las Vegas operates from a workshop and showroom in Las Vegas, Nevada. The business, registered as Live Edge Slabs, LLC, focuses on custom live edge tables. No founding year or ownership details are disclosed publicly.

The company produces custom live edge tables using imported exotic wood slabs that retain their natural edges and grain patterns. Each table is handcrafted on-site in the Las Vegas facility, with a hand-rubbed finish applied. The workshop also serves as a showroom where customers can view slabs in person and select material for their projects.

Testimonials reference homeowners and individual clients who visit the showroom to choose slabs with assistance from staff members such as Bill and Gloria.

