UPDATE companies SET description='LuRay Textiles, Inc. operates a knitted-fabric mill in North Wilkesboro, North Carolina. The company was founded in 1984 and has remained a domestic producer of technical and commodity textiles.

The mill produces knitted fabrics using American-sourced yarn, running fibers that range from cotton and polyester to high-performance aramids such as Kevlar®, Nomex® and PBI®. In addition to yard goods, the facility manufactures wiping cloths and rags cut for automotive detailing, furniture finishing and general industrial cleaning.

The fabric line is sold in multiple weights and widths for garments, protective sleeves and other sewn products, while the wiping-cloth assortment targets car-care retailers and furniture refinishers.

