UPDATE companies SET description='MMR Group, Inc. is headquartered in Baton Rouge, Louisiana, and operates 30 offices across North and South America. The company employs approximately 725 people and consistently ranks at the top of Engineering News-Record''s specialty contractors list.

The firm provides a multi-disciplined suite of services including electrical construction, instrumentation, power distribution, panel and modular control building fabrication, telecommunications and security systems, commissioning and start-up, power development, maintenance, and mission critical construction. MMR self-performs electrical, telecommunications, security, fire alarm, and gas services to reduce cycle times and cost per megawatt. A Modular Systems facility in Lafayette, Louisiana, supports off-site data-center skid assembly.

MMR serves chemical and petrochemical, oil and gas (upstream, midstream, downstream), industrial manufacturing, power generation, power development, renewable energy and energy storage, and telecommunications and security sectors. Clients include Black Hills Energy (Cheyenne Prairie natural-gas turbine project), Kinder Morgan (Elba Island 35kV/15kV), Shell Canada (Albian Oil Sands), Procter & Gamble (tissue machine plant), GE/Entergy (Perryville blackstart storage), and Chevron (Big Foot platform).

The company cites its diverse expertise, commitment to safety, quality, and client satisfaction, and the ability to complete projects on schedule and within budget as key differentiators. Since inception, MMR has demonstrated competency across broad sectors, combining state-of-the-art project controls, cutting-edge technology, and certified craftsmen to deliver critical infrastructure.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Instrument & Technical Services", "Electrical Construction", "Power Distribution", "Panel & Modular Control Building Fabrication", "Telecommunications & Security Systems", "Commissioning & Start-Up", "Power Development", "Maintenance Services", "Mission Critical Construction", "Power Engineering & Utility Services", "Constructability Reviews", "Pre-Planning & Commissioning Procedures", "Pre-Commissioning & Start-Up Assistance", "Cable Installation & Termination", "Tubing Installation", "Grounding, Conduit, Cable Tray, Lighting", "Instrument Installation & Loop Check", "Modular Systems Assembly & Testing", "Project Controls & Management", "Safety Management"], "industries": ["Chemical & Petrochemical", "Oil & Gas (Upstream, Midstream, Downstream)", "Industrial Manufacturing", "Power Generation", "Power Development", "Renewable Energy & Energy Storage", "Telecommunications & Security Systems"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Self-perform electrical construction, telecommunications, security, fire alarm, and gas services", "Reduce cycle times and cost per megawatt", "Multi-disciplined program and project management approach", "State-of-the-art project controls, cutting-edge technology, certified craftsmen", "Modular Systems facility for off-site data-center skid assembly and testing"], "facts_used": ["Headquarters in Baton Rouge, Louisiana -> db", "30 offices across North and South America -> /", "725 employees -> db", "Top-ranked specialty contractor per ENR ->