UPDATE companies SET description='Maddox Industrial Transformer was founded in 2015 by a group of transformer industry veterans led by Camden Spiller in Simpsonville, South Carolina. The company is headquartered in Battle Ground, Washington, and operates seven facilities across the United States, including locations in Greer, Pelham, Fountain Inn, and Woodruff, South Carolina; Batavia, Ohio; Moscow, Idaho; and Houston, Texas.

