UPDATE companies SET description='Mainstreet Iowa Apparel operates from Cedar Rapids, Iowa, where it was established to serve local businesses, schools, teams, and organizations with custom-decorated apparel. The company does not disclose its founding year or ownership structure, but its leadership includes Vice President Anthony Hobson, graphic designer Curt Zebuhr, embroidery technician Cindy Knock, and marketing and inside sales lead Taylor Zebuhr.

