riven (2nd and 3rd tier) -> /", "Distributor with Assembly capabilities -> /", "End to End Component Application Development -> /"], "company_type": "Distributor / reseller", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Marsh Electronics, has been a leading source as an electronic and electromechanical distributor for 90 years.", "founded_year": "1935", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='marsh-electronics-inc' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Marsh Medical operates from Newell, West Virginia, as a dedicated medical component brand under Marsh Bellofram, a U.S. manufacturer with a history exceeding 125 years. The division was created to consolidate nearly five decades of experience supplying critical components to the medical device industry.

The company designs and manufactures pressure and flow regulators, electro-pneumatic controls, transducers, electronic timing controls, and open medical power supplies. In-house engineers and chemists develop custom solutions, drawing on a portfolio of more than 100,000 custom parts that include precision air regulators, diaphragms, silicone components, and electrical wiring. During the COVID-19 pandemic, Marsh Medical added a second production shift running six days a week to meet surging demand for ventilator components.

The brand positions itself as a single access point for streamlined procurement of medical device components.

