UPDATE companies SET description='McGee Company was founded in 1951 in Albuquerque, New Mexico, and has remained family-owned since its inception. The company began with a simple goal: to anticipate customer needs by keeping the right products in stock and ready to ship. Today it operates warehouses in Denver, Salt Lake City, Albuquerque, Atlanta, and Dallas, serving the American West with a broad inventory of automotive service equipment and supplies.

