UPDATE companies SET description='Medical Device Depot, Inc. was founded in 2007 in Fairview, Pennsylvania, as a woman- and minority-owned small business. The company began with the goal of simplifying how healthcare professionals worldwide purchase medical equipment, addressing a market where suppliers often lacked the training to properly support buyers.

