UPDATE companies SET description='Mercury Plastics, Inc. was founded in 1955 in Chicago, Illinois. The company has operated continuously since then as a manufacturer of thermoformed packaging, plastic fabricated parts, and printed products.

The company provides a range of capabilities under one roof, including engineering and design, mill operations, in-house sheet extrusion, custom printing, thermoforming, and plastic fabrication. It operates four manufacturing sites and two warehouses totaling more than 500,000 square feet of production space. No headcount or annual volume figures are disclosed.

Mercury Plastics serves customers in food packaging, retail and point-of-sale displays, consumer packaging, automotive, and healthcare and medical devices. The firm emphasizes its ability to handle projects of any size, stating that no job is too large.

The company''s stated mission is to simplify customers'' lives by consolidating multiple processes in a single facility. It pursues a zero-defects goal through stringent quality control and continuous improvement. Mercury also positions itself as an environmental leader, offering recycled, reprocessed, and blended plastic materials to help clients meet sustainability targets.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Thermoforming", "Plastic fabrication", "Printing", "Engineering and design", "Mill operations", "In-house sheet extrusion", "Custom printing", "Recycled material processing"], "industries": ["Food packaging", "Retail and point of sale", "Consumer packaging", "Automotive", "Healthcare and medical devices"], "materials": ["Recycled plastics", "Reprocessed plastics", "Blended plastics"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Comprehensive capabilities under one roof (engineering, mill operations, in-house sheet extrusion, custom printing)", "Zero defects goal with stringent quality control", "Environmental leadership with recycled, reprocessed, blended plastic materials", "Four manufacturing sites and two warehouses totaling 500k+ sq ft", "No job too large"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1955 -> /about", "Headquarters Chicago, Illinois -> db", "Four manufacturing sites, two warehouses, 500k+ sq ft -> /", "Industries: food packaging, retail and point of sale, consumer packaging, automotive, healthcare and medical devices -> /", "Capabilities: thermoforming, plastic fabrication, printing, engineering & design, mill operations, in-house sheet extrusion, custom printing -> /, /about", "Environmental responsibility: recycled, reprocessed, blended plastic materials -> /", "Zero defects goal -> /about", "Mission to simplify customers'' lives -> /, /about"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Since 1955, Mercury Plastics, Inc. has been a beacon of excellence in the rea