er / job shop", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Fabricating custom, high quality, precision metal products.", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='metal-creations-design-fabrication' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Metal Rite Manufacturing LLC has operated from El Prado, New Mexico since 1996. The family-owned company was founded in response to demand for faster local service in the metal roofing market, where the prevailing turnaround was one to three weeks.

The shop roll-forms a range of metal roofing and gutter profiles, including Master Rib, Tuff Rib, PBR, Corrugated, Standing Seam, and Seamless Gutter. Production is geared toward regional delivery across northern New Mexico and southern Colorado, with a focus on short lead times.

