UPDATE companies SET description='Metal-Tech Inc. was founded in 1969 in New Castle, Delaware. The company began as a job shop with the intention of offering more than single-part machining, describing itself as a "small factory" capable of producing complete products from fabrication through assembly and delivery.

Operating from a facility of over 50,000 square feet, Metal-Tech provides sheet metal fabrication, CNC milling and turning, prototype machining, tube and wire bending, welding (including TIG, silver solder, and soft solder), wet and powder coating painting, and both mechanical and electrical assembly. Equipment includes Mori-Seiki and Kitamura machining centers with pallet changers, Proto Trak CNC mills and a lathe, and a turret punch for sheet metal.

The company serves customers requiring prototype and production metal fabrication, machining, and assembly services, though specific industry sectors are not detailed in available sources.

Metal-Tech emphasizes a commitment to quality, competitive pricing, and on-time delivery. It differentiates itself by offering flexible shipping options—single delivery per order, delayed shipments scheduled up to 12 months, or on-demand shipping—and by handling complete product build-outs rather than individual components.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Sheet Metal Fabrication", "CNC Milling", "CNC Turning", "Prototype Machining", "Tube Bending", "Wire Bending", "TIG Welding", "Silver Soldering", "Soft Soldering", "Wet Painting", "Powder Coating", "Mechanical Assembly", "Electrical Assembly", "Wire Harness Assembly", "Precision Machining of Castings"], "industries": [], "materials": ["Aluminum", "Stainless Steel", "Plastics"], "equipment": ["Mori-Seiki MV 40 machining center with pallet changer", "Kitamura Mycenter 3Xi machining center with pallet changer", "Kitamura Mycenter 3X machining center", "Kitamura Mycenter 4X machining center", "Proto Trak CNC Vertical Mill with X, Y and Z control", "Proto Trak CNC Vertical Mills with X and Y control", "Proto Trak CNC Lathe", "Turret Punch"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Flexible shipping: single delivery, delayed up to 12 months, or on-demand", "Over 50,000 sq ft manufacturing space", "Prototype capabilities including small tubing and wire bending", "TIG welding expertise on thin-gauge aluminum and stainless steel", "Batch-system wet and powder coating with 400\u00b0F oven"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1969 -> db", "Headquarters New Castle, DE -> db", "Facility over 50,000 sq ft -> /", "Capabilities: sheet metal, CNC milling/turning, welding, painting, assembly -> /", "Equipment: Mori-Seiki MV 40, Kitamura Mycenter series, Proto Trak mills/lathe, turret punch -> /", "Materials: aluminum, stainless steel, plastics -> /", "Shipping options: single delivery, delayed up to 12 months, on-demand -> /", "Differentiator: not just a job shop, small factory concept -> /